return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-02T07:33:02+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, remote purge from your Zinn® dashboard, a Redis object-cache toggle, safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions, and one-click admin login. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead.'=>'Don shafukan da aka karɓi baƙon su a Zinn Digital®. Yana sarrafa cache ɗin shafin da uwar garken ku na Zinn® ke bayarwa riga - tsaftace atomatik mai wayo yayin canjin abun ciki, tsaftace nesa daga dashboard ɗin ku na Zinn®, maɓallin rabe-rabe na abu na Redis, keɓewar WordPress/WooCommerce amintattu, da shiga admin da dannawa ɗaya. Wannan mai sarrafa cache ne, ba injin cache ba. Ana karɓar baƙon wani wuri? Sanya Zinn® Cache Engine maimakon haka.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Ba ka da izinin tsaftace cache.','Cache purge requested.'=>'An nemi tsaftace cache.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: an shigar da wani rukunin raba abu na dabam, don haka wannan plugin din ba ya sarrafa maballin abu na Redis.','Full-page cache (LiteSpeed)'=>'Cikakken cache na shafi (LiteSpeed)','Enable LSCache control'=>'Kunna sarrafa LSCache','Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages.'=>'Aika headers na sarrafa cache da tag na LiteSpeed a shafuka masu iya cachewa.','Public cache lifetime (seconds)'=>'Tsawon rayuwar cache na jama\'a (daƙiƙa)','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Cache na abu (Redis)','Enable Redis object cache'=>'Kunna cache na abu na Redis','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in (requires the phpredis extension).'=>'Shigar da drop-in na cache na abu na Redis (yana buƙatar tsawaita phpredis).','Redis host'=>'Mai gida na Redis','Redis port'=>'Tashar Redis','Redis database'=>'Bayanan Redis','Redis key prefix'=>'Prefix ɗin maɓalli na Redis','Automatic purging'=>'Tsaftacewa ta atomatik','Smart auto-purge'=>'Tsaftacewa ta atomatik mai wayo','Purge affected pages automatically when content changes.'=>'Tsaftace shafuka da abin ya shafa ta atomatik lokacin da abun ciki ya canja.','Purge on updates'=>'Tsaftacewa akan sabuntawa','Purge everything after core, plugin, or theme updates.'=>'Tsaftace komai bayan sabunta core, plugin, ko jigo.','Cache exclusions'=>'Keɓancewar cache','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied (cart, checkout, my-account, logged-in and session pages are never cached). Add extra rules below, one per line.'=>'Ana amfani da ma\'aunin da suka dace na WordPress da WooCommerce koyaushe (shafukan kwando, biya, asusuna, waɗanda aka shiga da kuma na zama ba a taɓa cache su ba). Ƙara ƙarin ƙa\'idodi a ƙasa, ɗaya kowane layi.','Exclude URL paths (prefix match)'=>'Keɓe hanyoyin URL (daidaitawar prefix)','Exclude query keys'=>'Keɓe maɓallan tambaya','Exclude cookie name prefixes'=>'Keɓe prefix ɗin sunayen cookie','Maintenance'=>'Kulawa','Purge everything now'=>'Tsaftace komai yanzu','detected'=>'an gano','not detected'=>'ba a gano ba','phpredis extension missing'=>'tsawaita phpredis ta ɓace','active'=>'mai aiki','inactive'=>'mara aiki','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Cache na LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Cache na abu na Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Tsawaita PHP na Redis (phpredis) ba ya samuwa a wannan sabar, don haka ba za a iya kunna cache na abu ba.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Wani matatse na adana abubuwa na musamman na abu (object-cache drop-in) an riga an shigar da shi. Cire shi kafin ka kunna Zinn® object cache.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Ba a iya rubuta fayil ɗin saitin haɗin Redis ba.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Ba a iya karanta drop-in na cache na abu da aka haɗa ba.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Ba a iya shigar da drop-in na cache na abu cikin wp-content ba.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Ba a iya cire drop-in na cache na abu ba.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Tsarin fayil na WordPress ba a iya rubuta shi, don haka ba a iya sarrafa drop-in na cache na abu ba.','This one-click login link is not valid any more. Links expire after a couple of minutes and can only be used once — open your site from the Zinn® dashboard again to get a fresh one.'=>'Wannan hanyar haɗi ta shiga ta danna-ɗaya ba ta da aiki yanzu. Hanyoyin haɗi suna ƙarewa bayan mintuna kaɗan kuma ana iya amfani da su sau ɗaya ne kawai — buɗe shafinka daga allon kula na Zinn® kuma don samun sabuwa.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Dubi bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta kasa wucewa binciken amincinta, don haka ba a girka ta ba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Gojin Zinn® don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, madogaransa na kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma allon sarrafawa wanda aka gina domin mutanen da suke gudanar da fiye da shafi ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da aka kafa, yankunan yanar gizo da kuma wuraren sanya hanyoyin haɗi, tare da riƙe kuɗin lafiya har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — hayar mutanen da ke yin wannan don rayuwa','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko buga wani aikin kuma bari su yi gwanjo.']];